---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Marta Easy - Support"
  description="Need help with Marta Easy?"
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/marta-easy/support"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-8">Support</h1>

        <div class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-12">
          <p class="text-lg mb-4">Need help with Marta Easy?</p>
          <p>Contact support at <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Marta%20Easy%20Support" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>. We usually respond quickly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">What data does Marta Easy use?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">The app uses MARTA transit and status data. We do not create user accounts and do not track personal behavior for advertising.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Does it work offline?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Yes. If connectivity is weak, recent schedule information and favorites remain available so you can continue planning your commute.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">How do I see the leave-in recommendation?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Open the Home card and choose a station and stop. The recommendation updates as departure predictions change.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Can I choose favorite stops?</h3>
              <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Yes. Add your most-used stops to favorites to jump directly to the status you check most often.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
